docs/design-notes.md-2468-The frontend server is projected-only. Every active input root is independently overridable for nonstandard deployments and test fixtures. Rotating hourly/part NDJSON is tailed through a shared reader that advances its byte cursor only after a complete line; incomplete writes remain for the next poll.
